DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31406::$$$message_0241_0000_0000$$$::The sky is near.[lr]::
31407::$$$message_0241_0000_0001$$$::This is the tallest building in the city. From up here, all of Fuyuki is brightly lit by the moon.[lr]::
31408::$$$message_0241_0000_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
31409::$$$message_0241_0000_0003$$$::I didn't come up here for any particular reason.::
31410::$$$message_0241_0001_0000$$$::I'm not looking out at the town.[lr]::
31411::$$$message_0241_0001_0001$$$::My eyes are fixed firmly upwards.[lr]::
31412::$$$message_0241_0001_0002$$$::The moon is so close.[lr]::
31413::$$$message_0241_0001_0003$$$::Its crescent shape resembles a chalice, somehow.[lr]::
31414::$$$message_0241_0001_0004$$$::Once, I had the silly idea that I could reach out and touch the moon with my hand from up here.[lr]::
31415::$$$message_0241_0001_0005$$$::I'd need a rocket ship to go to the moon, of course.[lr]::
31416::$$$message_0241_0001_0006$$$::That, or an unimaginably long ladder.::
31417::$$$message_0241_0002_0000$$$::"I should head back. There's nothing I can do here on my own."[lr]::
31418::$$$message_0241_0002_0001$$$::I leave the silver, lunar will behind.[lr]::
31419::$$$message_0241_0002_0002$$$::This is where the sky is.[lr]::
31420::$$$message_0241_0002_0003$$$::There's no reaching the beginning, no matter how tall of a tower one has.::

